{{Documentation/Header}}
A rich group card built entirely from a group's own page. Given a group name it reads the image, kanji name and description from that page's infobox via <code><nowiki>{{#invoke:UtaiteUnit|getParameter}}</nowiki></code> and <code><nowiki>{{#invoke:Utaite|getParameter}}</nowiki></code>, then renders the member list with <code><nowiki>{{#invoke:UtaiteGroups|processPage}}</nowiki></code>.

Because everything is pulled live, a card never needs updating when the group's page changes.

Prefers the infobox's <code>Image2</code> field, falling back to <code>Image</code>.

==Syntax==
{{T|UtaiteGroupCard|v1=group page name}}

==Usage==
Wrap a set of cards in a gallery container:
<pre>
<div class="utaite-groups-gallery">
{{UtaiteGroupCard|IRREGULAR DICE}}
{{UtaiteGroupCard|StarLight PolaRis}}
{{UtaiteGroupCard|Chrono Reverse}}
</div>
</pre>

<div class="utaite-groups-gallery">{{UtaiteGroupCard|IRREGULAR DICE}}{{UtaiteGroupCard|StarLight PolaRis}}{{UtaiteGroupCard|Chrono Reverse}}</div>

